<title>USA: Polak tenders for control of PerfectData.</title>
<headline>Polak tenders for control of PerfectData.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH HOLLYWOOD, Calif. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polak Investment Group said Friday it was making a tender offer of $5.50 a share for an additional 42 percent of the outstanding shares of PerfectData Corp.</p>
<p>The move would increase Polak's holdings to about 51 percent of PerfectData's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The offer of $5.50 a share consists of a combination of cash and preferred stock and is contingent on approval by Perfectdata shareholders and directors.</p>
<p>Polak said in a statement it intends to use PerfectData to make further business combinations or acquisitions.</p>
